SRC/anagram -- anagram, as built for OS-9/68000===============================================ORIG holds the post as comp.sources.games carried it.  anagram.c differsonly inside #ifdef OSK: its default word list is /dd/GAMES/words, thelower-case list this disk already carries, instead of /usr/dict/words.sysexits.h is new: OS-9 has none, and it defines the four exit codes theprogram uses with BSD's values.